    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Face different situations that are the daily life of tower controllers around the world, from communication failures to terrorist attacks, you will learn to work under a lot of pressure as you advance between the different levels.<br><br>As and Air Traffic Controller your mission is to control the air drome by moving, landing and depart planes, get ready to face a different puzzle in every level that will put your knowledge to the test, this game will contain over 20 different levels full of real life situations and adrenaline.<br>This game has a badge system that will reward you if you manage to pass the level with three stars, do you have what it takes to unlock all available badges and become the legendary Air Traffic Controller?<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057500/extras/3c05fc027aba02b0cacafec9e966eb8c.poster.avif?t=1732199673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057500/extras/3c05fc027aba02b0cacafec9e966eb8c.webm?t=1732199673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057500/extras/3c05fc027aba02b0cacafec9e966eb8c.mp4?t=1732199673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Face different situations that are the daily life of tower controllers around the world, from communication failures to terrorist attacks, you will learn to work under a lot of pressure as you advance between the different levels.<br><br>As and Air Traffic Controller your mission is to control the air drome by moving, landing and depart planes, get ready to face a different puzzle in every level that will put your knowledge to the test, this game will contain over 20 different levels full of real life situations and adrenaline.<br>This game has a badge system that will reward you if you manage to pass the level with three stars, do you have what it takes to unlock all available badges and become the legendary Air Traffic Controller?<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057500/extras/3c05fc027aba02b0cacafec9e966eb8c.poster.avif?t=1732199673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057500/extras/3c05fc027aba02b0cacafec9e966eb8c.webm?t=1732199673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2057500/extras/3c05fc027aba02b0cacafec9e966eb8c.mp4?t=1732199673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
